<h1>Title with <em>emphasis</em></h1>
<p>Intro paragraph with <strong>bold</strong>, <em>italic</em>, and <code>code &lt;b&gt;</code>. It continues on a second line &amp; has entities &lt; &gt; &quot;quotes&quot;.</p>
<h2>Lists</h2>
<ul>
<li>first item</li>
<li>second <strong>bold</strong> item</li>
<li>third item</li>
</ul>
<ol>
<li>one</li>
<li>two</li>
<li>three with <a href="http://example.com?a=1&amp;b=2">a link</a></li>
</ol>
<h3>Code</h3>
<pre><code class="lang-python">def f(x):
    return x &lt; 3 and y &gt; 2</code></pre>
<blockquote>quoted text across lines</blockquote>
<hr>
<p>Escaped *star* and unmatched <em> star, trailing </em>*bold. ####### not a heading</p>
<h4>Level four</h4>
-----
20 lines; 6 list items
'plain' -> plain
'**b**' -> <strong>b</strong>
'*i*' -> <em>i</em>
'***both***' -> <strong>*both</strong>*
'a * b' -> a * b
'`x`' -> <code>x</code>
'[x](y)' -> <a href="y">x</a>
'[x]' -> [x]
'snake_case_name' -> snake<em>case</em>name
'&<>' -> &amp;&lt;&gt;

''
